{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game where all you need to do is wait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to leave the game running while you play something else or watch videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An event will definitely occur after 2 hours, so make sure to return at that time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, events may also happen earlier. Five minutes before an appearance, the door will open as a signal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After witnessing an event, you will have 1 minute to open the gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Opening the gallery after an event will unlock an achievement.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Note:</strong><br>Once you finish, you must start over from the beginning, so be careful not to press Esc by mistake.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply staring at the blank screen is recommended only for those who have the spare time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015400?t=1758922928","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015400?t=1758922928","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015400/bb181e837a0cab7a963398d2104a2bc9ea35d173/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758922928","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015400/bb181e837a0cab7a963398d2104a2bc9ea35d173/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758922928","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game where all you need to do is wait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to leave the game running while you play something else or watch videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An event will definitely occur after 2 hours, so make sure to return at that time.</p><p 